// performance_monitor.rs.template
// Performance monitoring implementation for multilayer ensemble system
//
// DESIGN DECISIONS:
// - Real-time metrics collection with minimal overhead
// - Hierarchical monitoring (system -> ensemble -> model -> layer)
// - Adaptive alerting based on performance trends
// - Historical data analysis for performance optimization
// - Integration with existing health monitoring infrastructure
//
// INTEGRATION POINTS:
// - src/monitoring/health/component_checkers.rs (health monitoring)
// - ensemble_predictor.rs (ensemble performance tracking)
// - specialization_layer_impl.rs (layer-specific metrics)
// - Redis for metrics storage and alerting
// - Prometheus/Grafana for visualization (optional)

